To update the static website for production:

1) make changes to underlying .rmd files

2) in terminal type: bundle exec jekyll serve

3) open https://localhost:4000 to look at site 

4) in terminal type: bundle exec jekyll build

5) commit and push changes

6) confirm site updates

  6a) if site doesn't update within a few minutes check:
    - github actions completed successfully
    - Netlify (www.netlify.com) that deploy was successful

